 of the famous Mayan city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when booking a tour."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guided "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "directed by a tour guide "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to book a guided tour."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "opening "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of time that is available  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you have any openings in May?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "history "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "things that happened in the past "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to learn about history."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to book (you) in "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "reserving a spot for you "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm booking you in for May 24th. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bird-watching "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an activity looking at and recognizing different types of wild birds "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I enjoy bird watching."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a place you want to go to on